<title>USA: M.S. Carriers sees Q1 exceeding forecasts.</title>
<headline>M.S. Carriers sees Q1 exceeding forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.S. Carriers Inc said Tuesday it expects first-quarter earnings to exceed analysts' expectations of $0.16-$0.17 per share. The company gave no specifics.</p>
<p>The irregular route truckload carrier said earnings were boosted by additional capacity, strong freight demand and continuing cost reductions.</p>
